STAFF MEMO
Re: Happy Jack Rd./F.E. Warren AFB Enhanced Use Lease Infrastructure Project
From: Robert Briggs, AICP, Director of Planning and Development
To: Mayor and City Council
Date: February 7, 2018
Recommendation:
Staff recommends amending by substitution to adopt the attached amended grant resolutions.
Background:
The Happy Jack Rd./F.E. Warren AFB Enhanced Use Lease Infrastructure Project grant application and
loan resolutions first appeared before the City Council on January 22, 2018 and were referred to the
Finance Committee on February 5, 2018. The Finance Committee moved to recommended adoption of
both resolutions.
Staff is recommending adoption of the attached resolutions by substitution. They are nearly identical in
those reviewed by the Financ&Committee. They make only two language changes to make it clear that
the grant will include some public roadway improvements, as well as the water and sewer main
construction. City staff believes these changes better define the scope of the project, and provide for
best utilization of the grant and loan dollars if awarded.
