Base, the Greater Cheyenne Chamber of Commerce, and Cheyenne LEADS; and

WHEREAS, the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne held a public hearing on
January 22, 2018, to solicit testimony from citizens, and gave full consideration to all comments
received.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that a BRC Business Committed grant application in the
amount of $3,000,000.00 and loan application in an amount not to exceed $3,000,000.00 be
submitted to the Wyoming Business Council for consideration of assistance in funding the
Happy Jack Road/F.E. Warren Air Force Base Enhanced Use Lease Infrastructure Project.

